#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/

# Symbolication, Obfuscation and resources
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Pods/
**/android/.gradle/

# Exceptions to above rules.
!/packages/flutter_tools/test/data/dart_dependencies_test/**/.packages

# Python reference implementation (runnable validation, not shipped code)
reference/__pycache__/
reference/.pytest_cache/
reference/out/
*.egg-info/
